<title>FRANCE: Elf says sold CNP stake to Fibelpar.</title>
<headline>Elf says sold CNP stake to Fibelpar.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elf Aquitaine said it had sold its entire 7.06 percent stake, or 1,787,793 shares, in Belgium's Compagnie Nationale a Portefeuille (CNP) to Fibelpar, also of Belgium.</p>
<p>A spokesman for the company could not indicate the value.  </p>
<p>Elf said the disposal was in line with its policy of reducing its financial interests. It said it already sold its remaining shares in Petrofina and Generale des Eaux during the first half of 1996.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
